---
layout: shell
title: Components
permalink: /index.html
---
<h1>Components</h1>
<p class="lead">Every component the kit ships, rendered by the kit's own plugin with the starter course's data. What you see here is what a course's build produces.</p>
<section webc:for="group of $data.catalog.groups">
	<h2 @text="group.title"></h2>
	<p @text="group.description"></p>
	<ul role="list" class="index">
		<li webc:for="component of group.components">
			<a :href="component.url"><code @text="component.tag"></code></a>
			<span @html="component.summaryHtml"></span>
		</li>
	</ul>
</section>
